# CSS / Less styling rules
- Use SMACSS architecture
- Always style the UI as designed by a world-class web designer
- Keep the UI sleek and minimalistic
- Never hardcode colors, use the variables in the `less/base/variables.less` file
- Styles are desktop-first. When implementing responsive styles, use media queries to add mobile styles. Example:
```less
.desktop-styles {
  // ...
}
@media (max-width: @screen-sm-max) {
  .mobile-styles {
    // ...
  }
}
```